  "description": "With multiple podiums and dominating on multiple terrains, Fourstroke 01 is a race-proven XCO machine engineered to meet the needs of elite riders. Equipped with our APS dual-link suspension system, every pedal stroke will be translated into race speed. Travel is fine tuned to 110 mm front and 100 mm rear with Rockshox SID SL Select 3P fork and SIDLUXE Select+ 3P rear shock bringing balance and performance on the toughest tracks. Built around a Premium Carbon frame with BMC modern geometry and integrated protections, it fits two bottles for endurance stages. Transmission is guaranteed by the sharp SHIMANO SLX, and wheels are the highly reliable DT Swiss X 1900.",
